---
<section id="about" class="py-20" style="background: var(--yellow); border-top: 3px solid var(--black); border-bottom: 3px solid var(--black);">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <!-- LEFT — stacked info cards -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4" data-aos="fade-right">
        <div class="nb-card bg-[var(--white)] p-4">
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 mb-1">🎓 Studying at</p>
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-base text-black">SMKN 2 Magelang · PPLG Major</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nb-card bg-[var(--white)] p-4">
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 mb-1">💼 Working at</p>
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-base text-black">Reka Solusi Teknologi</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nb-card bg-[var(--white)] p-4">
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 mb-1">📍 Location</p>
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-base text-black">Magelang, Central Java, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nb-card p-4" style="background: var(--pink);">
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase font-bold text-white/80 mb-1">🤝 Open to</p>
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-base text-white">Freelance & Collaboration</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT — text content -->
      <div data-aos="fade-left">
        <span class="nb-section-label">[ ABOUT ME ]</span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl mb-4">I turn ideas into code — and coffee into commits.</h2>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-gray-800 mb-4 leading-relaxed">I'm an ambitious and passionate developer with a strong interest in web development, game design, physics, and music. My journey started with curiosity about how things work — it grew into a commitment to building meaningful digital experiences.</p>
        <p class="text-[15px] text-gray-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Currently studying at SMKN 2 Magelang (PPLG major) and working full-time at Reka Solusi Teknologi, I experiment daily with Next.js, Laravel, Flutter, Three.js, and anything that challenges me. When I'm not coding, I'm exploring game engines, thinking about physics, or listening to music.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--yellow);">Game Engines</span>
          <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--yellow);">Physics</span>
          <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--yellow);">Music</span>
          <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--yellow);">Open Source</span>
          <span class="nb-tag" style="background: var(--yellow);">3D Graphics</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>